1. Build and Run the Stack
Spin up all microservices in detached mode:

docker compose up -d --build

2. Inspect Container Status and Health
Verify that both services are running and redis-db reports (healthy) status:

docker compose ps

3. Test Service Ingress and Page Counter
Execute curl to send traffic to the Node.js service and trigger Redis counters:

curl http://localhost:3000
curl http://localhost:3000
curl http://localhost:3000

